title Home Assistant: the keyboard's 2-D focus: the first key shows it (the launcher's highlight and an outline) on the first tile; Down into the light's slider row (Right +10 %), Up back, Up again to the tab bar, Right there switches the view; a tap hides the focus
sizes 480x320 640x480 800x480 1024x600 1280x720 1280x800 720x720 480x800 480x640 800x1280
env HA_DEMO home

wait 1600
key down
wait 300
shot focus-tile
check focus-tile
key right
wait 300
shot focus-right
key left
key down
wait 300
shot focus-slider
key right
wait 900
expect text "82 %"
shot focus-slider-up
check focus-slider-up
key up
key up
wait 300
shot focus-bar
check focus-bar
key right
wait 700
shot focus-bar-bedroom
check focus-bar-bedroom
expect text "Bedside lamp"
key down
wait 300
shot focus-bedroom-tile
key enter
wait 300
expect text "Blind"
expect noquit
